    "intro_html":  "Peri peri traveled from Mozambique to Portugal and back again, picking up garlic and lemon on the way, and it has been making cheap chicken taste expensive ever since. This version does the whole thing in one pot: chicken thighs, seasoned rice, bell pepper and a hot sauce base that stains everything a deep orange. Each bowl comes in at \u003cstrong\u003e565 calories and 34 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.18\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). One pot, one lid, fourteen dinners.",
